{
    "title": "City Patrol : Rescue Vehicles",
    "description": "Become a City Hero!\r\n\r\nCity Patrol is an entertaining game that introduces young children to the rescue and special services and their work.\r\n\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed for children:\r\n\r\n2.5D style graphics, simple and intuitive controls, and a large city and countryside with cars, people and animals.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat Can You Do?\r\n\r\nFight Fires: When a fire breaks out in the city, rush in with the fire truck or fly the fire helicopter to help put out the flames.\r\n\r\nClean the Streets: Help clean up the streets by collecting garbage, sorting it, and recycling it into useful items or toys.\r\n\r\nDrive a School Bus: Safely transport children to school.\r\n\r\nKeep the city in order: Patrol the city with a police car to maintain order.\r\n\r\nAssist the residents: use tow truck or cargo vehicle to move goods or help with car breakdowns.\r\n\r\nRace for Fun: After rescue missions, it's time to take a break ;) Enjoy racing with your favorite vehicles!\r\n\r\n\r\nWhy play City Patrol?\r\n\r\nTeaches sustainability: The game teaches waste sorting, and parents can adjust the sorting colors to match their country's standards.\r\n\r\nDevelops important skills: The game helps children improve their motor skills, problem-solving abilities, and sense of responsibility.\r\n\r\nVariety of tasks: The game includes many different mini-games, ensuring there's something interesting for everyone!\r\n\r\nChild-friendly: A simple control system and a safe environment allow children to focus on the game.\r\n\r\n\r\nLet your child learn and have fun with City Patrol, a game that fosters creativity and social responsibility!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Become a City Hero!<br><br>City Patrol is an entertaining game that introduces young children to the rescue and special services and their work.<br><br><br>Thoughtfully designed for children:<br><br>2.5D style graphics, simple and intuitive controls, and a large city and countryside with cars, people and animals.<br><br><br>What Can You Do?<br><br>Fight Fires: When a fire breaks out in the city, rush in with the fire truck or fly the fire helicopter to help put out the flames.<br><br>Clean the Streets: Help clean up the streets by collecting garbage, sorting it, and recycling it into useful items or toys.<br><br>Drive a School Bus: Safely transport children to school.<br><br>Keep the city in order: Patrol the city with a police car to maintain order.<br><br>Assist the residents: use tow truck or cargo vehicle to move goods or help with car breakdowns.<br><br>Race for Fun: After rescue missions, it&#39;s time to take a break ;) Enjoy racing with your favorite vehicles!<br><br><br>Why play City Patrol?<br><br>Teaches sustainability: The game teaches waste sorting, and parents can adjust the sorting colors to match their country&#39;s standards.<br><br>Develops important skills: The game helps children improve their motor skills, problem-solving abilities, and sense of responsibility.<br><br>Variety of tasks: The game includes many different mini-games, ensuring there&#39;s something interesting for everyone!<br><br>Child-friendly: A simple control system and a safe environment allow children to focus on the game.<br><br><br>Let your child learn and have fun with City Patrol, a game that fosters creativity and social responsibility!",
